---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import content from '../../i18n/en/install';

const lang = 'en';
---

<Layout
  title="Download & Install — CIPHER-MUX"
  description={content.hero.body}
  lang={lang}
  active="download"
>
  <div class="install-page">

    <section class="install-hero">
      <div class="install-kicker">Get started</div>
      <h1>From Mac to Cockpit.<br/><span class="accent">~20 minutes.</span> One-time.</h1>
      <p class="install-hero-body">{content.hero.body}</p>

      <div class="phase-strip">
        {[
          { n: '01', label: 'Installation', time: '~10 min' },
          { n: '02', label: 'First Launch', time: '~5 min' },
          { n: '03', label: 'First Result', time: '~5\u201310 min' },
          { n: '04', label: 'Next Steps', time: 'whenever' },
        ].map((p) => (
          <div class="phase-strip-box">
            <div class="phase-strip-num">PHASE {p.n}</div>
            <div class="phase-strip-label">{p.label}</div>
            <div class="phase-strip-time">{p.time}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>

      <div class="dmg-cta">
        <a href="#" class="dmg-btn">&darr; cipher-mux-0.9.0.dmg</a>
        <span class="dmg-meta">macOS &middot; Apple Silicon &middot; 142 MB &middot; SHA-256 verified</span>
      </div>

      <div class="disclosure-box">
        <div class="disclosure-label">Honestly</div>
        <p>Phase 1 requires terminal commands. Not because we think it's cool, but because Claude Code CLI is a prerequisite and doesn't install with a click. We'll walk you through step by step &mdash; copy/paste is enough.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="phase1" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">01 &middot; Installation</span>
        <span class="phase-time">~10 min &middot; one-time</span>
      </div>
      <h2>{content.phases[0].title}</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">{content.phases[0].lead}</p>

      <div class="step-block">
        <div class="step-badge-row">
          <div class="step-badge">A</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Install Claude Code CLI</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Prerequisite &mdash; nothing works without Claude Code. If you already have npm, it's a one-liner.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cm-terminal">
          <div class="cm-terminal-bar"><span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FF5F57"></span><span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FEBC2E"></span><span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#28C840"></span><span class="cm-terminal-title">Terminal &middot; Spotlight &rarr; Terminal</span></div>
          <div class="cm-terminal-body">
            <div class="t-comment"># If you already have npm &mdash; go directly:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Otherwise install Homebrew first:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> /bin/bash -c &quot;$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)&quot;</div>
            <div class="t-out">=&gt; Installation successful!</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Then Node &mdash; includes npm:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> brew install node</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># And now Claude Code:</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code</div>
            <div class="t-out">+ @anthropic-ai/claude-code@1.x.x</div>
            <div class="t-spacer"></div>
            <div class="t-comment"># Verify + first launch (browser login):</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> claude --version</div>
            <div class="t-out">claude-code 1.x.x</div>
            <div class="t-cmd"><span class="t-prompt">$</span> claude</div>
            <div class="t-out">&rarr; Browser opens, log in, tab closes.</div>
            <div class="t-out">&rarr; CLI is authorized. Ctrl+C to quit.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pitfall-card">
          <div class="pitfall-label">&#9888; Pitfalls</div>
          <ul>
            <li>You need an Anthropic account (Free/Pro/Max). Create one at claude.ai before you start.</li>
            <li>On first brew call, macOS installs Xcode Command Line Tools &mdash; that takes about 5 minutes. Patience.</li>
            <li>If npm install -g throws a permission warning, retry with sudo: <code>sudo npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-block">
        <div class="step-badge-row">
          <div class="step-badge">B</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Install CIPHER-MUX</h3>
            <p class="step-desc">Standard DMG flow. tmux is bundled &mdash; no more terminal needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="dmg-flow-grid">
          <div class="dmg-steps-box">
            <ol class="dmg-steps">
              <li><span class="dmg-step-num">1</span><div><strong>Open DMG</strong><br/>Double-click cipher-mux-0.9.0.dmg</div></li>
              <li><span class="dmg-step-num">2</span><div><strong>Drag to Applications</strong><br/>Standard macOS drag-and-drop</div></li>
              <li><span class="dmg-step-num">3</span><div><strong>First launch: Right-click &rarr; Open</strong><br/>Gatekeeper for unsigned app. One-time only.</div></li>
              <li><span class="dmg-step-num">4</span><div><strong>Grant permissions</strong><br/>Accessibility (for global shortcuts) &middot; optionally Microphone (for Voice)</div></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <div class="dmg-mock">
            <div class="dmg-mock-chrome"><span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FF5F57"></span><span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#FEBC2E"></span><span class="cm-terminal-dot" style="background:#28C840"></span><span class="dmg-mock-title">cipher-mux-0.9.0</span></div>
            <div class="dmg-mock-body"><div class="dmg-mock-icon">CM</div><div class="dmg-mock-arrow">&rarr;</div><div class="dmg-mock-target">A</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pitfall-card">
          <div class="pitfall-label">&#9888; Pitfalls</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Gatekeeper blocks first launch &mdash; Right-click &rarr; Open &rarr; Confirm. Normal double-click after that.</li>
            <li>Accessibility permission must be enabled in System Settings &rarr; Privacy.</li>
            <li>tmux is bundled internally &mdash; no manual installation needed.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="phase2" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">02 &middot; First Launch</span>
        <span class="phase-time">~5 min</span>
      </div>
      <h2>{content.phases[1].title}</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">{content.phases[1].lead}</p>

      <div class="companion-grid">
        <div class="companion-mock">
          <div class="companion-mock-header"><span><span class="accent">●</span> companion &middot; cell 1/1</span><span>relay</span></div>
          <div class="companion-mock-body">
            <div class="companion-name">relay &#9656;</div>
            <div class="companion-msg">Hey! I'm your guide. Three quick questions, then we get going.</div>
            <div class="companion-q"># Question 1</div>
            <div class="companion-qlabel">Coding background?</div>
            <div class="companion-opts"><span>None</span><span class="companion-opt--active">Some &#10003;</span><span>Lots</span></div>
            <div class="companion-q"># Question 2</div>
            <div class="companion-qlabel">AI experience?</div>
            <div class="companion-opts"><span>Never</span><span>ChatGPT etc.</span><span class="companion-opt--active">Claude Code &#10003;</span></div>
            <div class="companion-q"># Question 3</div>
            <div class="companion-qlabel">What do you want to build?</div>
            <div class="companion-input">Just exploring &mdash; maybe some notes tools_</div>
            <div class="companion-confirm">&#10003; user-profile.json created</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="companion-narrative">
          <div class="companion-narrative-title">How it works</div>
          <ol class="companion-steps">
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">1</span><div><strong>App opens &rarr; empty grid</strong><br/>A 1&times;1 layout to start. No overwhelm.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">2</span><div><strong>Companion cell pre-filled</strong><br/>The Companion &mdash; Relay by default &mdash; takes the first cell.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">3</span><div><strong>Three quick questions</strong><br/>Coding experience, AI background, goals. Saves a profile.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">4</span><div><strong>Language adapts</strong><br/>Companion now speaks at your level. No tech jargon without reason.</div></li>
            <li><span class="companion-step-n">5</span><div><strong>Open first project</strong><br/>Enter path or use demo project. Claude Code starts in the cell.</div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="phase3" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">03 &middot; First Result</span>
        <span class="phase-time">~5&ndash;10 min</span>
      </div>
      <h2>{content.phases[2].title}</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">{content.phases[2].lead}</p>

      <div class="actions-grid">
        <div class="action-card">
          <div class="action-num">ACTION 01</div>
          <h3>Type something</h3>
          <p>Give Claude a simple task in the first cell. You'll see it work, output appears in the terminal.</p>
          <div class="action-mini-grid"><div class="action-mini-cell action-mini-cell--active">CC &#9656;</div></div>
          <div class="action-terminal"><span class="accent">&#8250;</span> Explain what's happening in this project</div>
        </div>
        <div class="action-card">
          <div class="action-num">ACTION 02</div>
          <h3>Second session</h3>
          <p>Add column, open new session. Two parallel Claude cells. The core feature.</p>
          <div class="action-mini-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"><div class="action-mini-cell action-mini-cell--active">CC &#9656;</div><div class="action-mini-cell action-mini-cell--active">CC &#9656;</div></div>
          <div class="action-terminal"><span class="dim"># Shortcut</span><br/><span class="accent">&#8984; + &rarr;</span> adds column to the right</div>
        </div>
        <div class="action-card">
          <div class="action-num">ACTION 03</div>
          <h3>Discover sidebar</h3>
          <p>Open sidebar, notes tab, write first note. Memory lives here.</p>
          <div class="action-sidebar-mock"><div class="action-sidebar-left">NOTES</div><div class="action-sidebar-right">CC &#9656;</div></div>
          <div class="action-terminal"><span class="dim"># Shortcut</span><br/><span class="accent">&#8984; + B</span> toggles sidebar</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="outcome-strip">
        <div class="outcome-label">After these three actions you have</div>
        <div class="outcome-items">
          <span>&#10003; Claude Code running</span>
          <span>&#10003; Two parallel sessions</span>
          <span>&#10003; Grid &middot; Cells &middot; Focus understood</span>
          <span>&#10003; Sidebar + Notes found</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="phase4" class="install-phase">
      <div class="phase-header">
        <span class="phase-header-num">04 &middot; Next Steps</span>
        <span class="phase-time">whenever</span>
      </div>
      <h2>The Companion suggests &mdash; you choose</h2>
      <p class="install-lead">Depending on your skill level, the companion has different next steps. No pressure &mdash; you can also just go for it.</p>

      <div class="nextstep-grid">
        <div class="nextstep-card"><span class="nextstep-guide">Guide 02</span><div class="nextstep-tag">Beginner</div><h4>Voice + Notes</h4><p>Tomorrow I'll show you Voice Input and how to use Notes as a second brain.</p></div>
        <div class="nextstep-card"><span class="nextstep-guide">Guide 03</span><div class="nextstep-tag">Intermediate</div><h4>Workshop</h4><p>If you want, I'll show you the Workshop &mdash; how multiple sessions work together.</p></div>
        <div class="nextstep-card"><span class="nextstep-guide">Guide 03 + 05</span><div class="nextstep-tag">Power User</div><h4>MPO + Prompting</h4><p>You know what you're doing. Orchestration and prompt design if you want to go deeper.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="install-bottom">
      <h2>Ready? <span class="accent">Download it.</span></h2>
      <p>Apple Silicon recommended. Intel Macs work &mdash; without Ollama integration. Linux &amp; Windows: coming.</p>
      <div class="install-bottom-actions">
        <a href="#" class="dmg-btn">&darr; DMG &middot; Apple Silicon</a>
        <a href="#" class="dmg-btn dmg-btn--outline">&darr; DMG &middot; Intel (no Ollama)</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/cmarkus42/cipher-mux-electron" class="install-link">github / cipher-mux &#8599;</a>
        <a href={`/${lang}/docs`} class="install-link">docs &#8599;</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .install-page { max-width: var(--max-width); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 64px; }
  .accent { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .dim { color: var(--color-text-dim); }
  .install-hero { padding: 120px 0 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .install-kicker { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .install-hero h1 { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 76px); line-height: 0.98; letter-spacing: -1px; margin: 0 0 28px; }
  .install-hero-body { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-text-secondary); max-width: 760px; margin: 0 0 36px; }
  .phase-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; max-width: 920px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .phase-strip-box { background: var(--color-bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 14px 14px 12px; clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); }
  .phase-strip-num { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: var(--color-text-dim); letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .phase-strip-label { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .phase-strip-time { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-accent); letter-spacing: 0.8px; }
  .dmg-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin-top: 36px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .dmg-btn { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-bg); font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 14px 22px; display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); }
  .dmg-btn:hover { text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.9; }
  .dmg-btn--outline { background: transparent; color: var(--color-text); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .dmg-meta { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text-dim); letter-spacing: 0.8px; }
  .disclosure-box { margin-top: 28px; padding: 14px 18px; background: var(--color-bg-sunken); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent); max-width: 720px; }
  .disclosure-label { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-accent); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .disclosure-box p { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.45; margin: 0; }
  .install-phase { padding: 88px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .phase-header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .phase-header-num { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-accent); }
  .phase-time { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-dim); letter-spacing: 1px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 2px 8px; clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 6px), calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 6px); }
  .install-phase h2 { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); margin: 0 0 16px; line-height: 1.05; }
  .install-lead { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); max-width: 780px; line-height: 1.45; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .step-block { margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .step-badge-row { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .step-badge { flex: 0 0 44px; height: 44px; background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-bg); font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px); }
  .step-block h3 { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 6px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .step-desc { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.45; max-width: 720px; }
  .cm-terminal { margin: 14px 0; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); overflow: hidden; }
  .cm-terminal-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 8px 14px; background: var(--color-terminal-chrome); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .cm-terminal-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; }
  .cm-terminal-title { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-dim); margin-left: 8px; }
  .cm-terminal-body { background: var(--color-terminal-bg); padding: 14px 18px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-terminal-text); overflow-x: auto; }
  .t-comment { color: var(--color-text-dim); font-style: italic; }
  .t-cmd { color: var(--color-terminal-text); }
  .t-prompt { color: var(--color-accent); }
  .t-out { color: var(--color-text-dim); }
  .t-spacer { height: 6px; }
  .pitfall-card { border: 1px solid var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg-sunken); padding: 16px 18px; margin: 14px 0 0; clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); }
  .pitfall-label { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-warn); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .pitfall-card ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .pitfall-card li { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.5; padding: 6px 0; border-top: 1px dotted var(--color-border); }
  .pitfall-card li:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .pitfall-card li::before { content: '\203A '; color: var(--color-accent); font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px; }
  .pitfall-card code { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .dmg-flow-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 18px; align-items: start; }
  .dmg-steps-box { background: var(--color-bg-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 18px 20px; clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); }
  .dmg-steps { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .dmg-steps li { display: flex; gap: 14px; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px dotted var(--color-border); }
  .dmg-steps li:first-child { border-top: none; }
  .dmg-step-num { flex: 0 0 28px; height: 28px; border: 1.5px solid var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent); font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 6px), calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 6px); }
  .dmg-steps strong { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; color: var(--color-text); }
  .dmg-steps div { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-secondary); line-height: 1.4; }
  .dmg-mock { background: var(--color-terminal-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); clip-path: polygon(10px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 10px); overflow: hidden; }
  .dmg-mock-chrome { padding: 8px 12px; background: var(--color-terminal-chrome); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .dmg-mock-title { font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text-dim); margin-left: 10px; }
  .dmg-mock-body { padding: 36px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; }
  .dmg-mock-icon { width: 72px; height: 72px; background: var(--color-accent); clip-path: polygon(14px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 14px), calc(100% - 14px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 14px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 26px; color: var(--color-bg); }
  .dmg-mock-arrow { font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; color: var(--color-accent); opacity: 0.6; }
  .dmg-mock-target { width: 72px; height: 72px; border: 2px dashed var(--color-border); clip-path: polygon(14px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 14px), calc(100% - 14px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 14px); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: var(--color-text-dim); }
